==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Moe Uzumasa & Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

